    "notes": "SYNTHETIC. The ABSENCE state, and the one the Uplink is most easily wrong about. The presence primitive reports false, so RealFuels is not installed and neither engines nor boiloff is ever published. The section therefore withholds itself ENTIRELY rather than drawing an 'Ignition & ullage' heading over an empty grid: a heading with nothing under it claims the Uplink looked and found a vessel with no engines, and that is a different and false statement. What the picture shows is Fuel & DeltaV composing exactly as it does on a stock install."
  },
